athing training, awareness practice and mindful escape,  you may find your own ethereal land.", "short_description": "Ethereal Land is a unique meditation application of oriental ink painting style. \nIn this poetic world, you will:\n- Experience the changes of seasons\n- Discover inner peace in a relaxing mindfulness journey\n- Immerse yourself in the ink painting scenery\n\nOur goal is to bring you a new visual meditation experience. Through breathing training, awareness practice and mindful escape,  you may find your own ethereal land."}]}, "developer_name": "SFS Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://shufeishu.com/ethereal-land/Privacy_Policy_20220225.pdf", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "SFS Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://shufeishu.com/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "726368587961803"}, {"id": "810139357995560"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["RELAXATION_MEDITATION", "CASUAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "460563999185793"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 0, "nodes": []}, "baseline_offer": null, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": []}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "5332761006810729", "version": "0.0.27"}, "id": "5091692237557964", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", 